Date: Thu, 27 Aug 2026 20:03:29 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 5/5] Regenerate the lockfile pnpm never got to rewrite

pr/desktop-auto-launch replaced the auto-launch package with Electron's
native loginItem API and removed it from apps/desktop/package.json, but the
lockfile still carried auto-launch, @types/auto-launch, its
patchedDependencies entry, electron-window-state and applescript - along
with a reference to a patch file that no longer exists.

A frozen install therefore refuses to proceed on this branch:
ERR_PNPM_LOCKFILE_CONFIG_MISMATCH. Written by pnpm, not by hand.

Fork-Feature: fork-tooling
